{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"histogram-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"histogram-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer","keys":["histogram-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Sturges és un punt de partida senzill per a mostres més petites. Arrel- quadrada usa l' arrel quadrada de la mida de la mostra. Freedman- Diaconis usa l' interval interquartil i es pot adaptar a la dispersió i als valors atípics. També podeu escollir el compte de compartiments vosaltres mateixos.","record_id":"03dfd7bc473f7ac79848bf2bcb63605a8c25d744540eb1893d526b224ff63d16","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.7286835511249876,"source":"Sturges is a simple starting point for smaller samples. Square-root uses the square root of the sample size. Freedman–Diaconis uses the interquartile range and can adapt to spread and outliers. You can also choose the bin count yourself.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"0a96d5869b86e37c9fbcae83f95b8d16d3959d43ca34769c1614df34249b9bdb","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Sturges és un punt de partida senzill per a mostres més petites. Arrel- quadrada usa l' arrel quadrada de la mida de la mostra. Freedman- Diaconis usa l' interval interquartil i es pot adaptar a la dispersió i als valors atípics. També podeu escollir el compte de compartiments vosaltres mateixos.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
